cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FMCG Price Intelligence: daily shelf-price intelligence for soft drinks in Ireland"
abstract: >-
  A daily, automated read of SuperValu Ireland shelf prices for Coca-Cola, Pepsi and other soft-drink
  brands that separates regular from promotional prices, normalises price per litre, benchmarks the
  full-sugar premium against Ireland's Sugar Sweetened Drinks Tax and compares brands pack for pack.
